?t=1756922995\" width=627 height=111 /></span><br>Most of the story concepts of this game are connected to characters, their feelings and desires. Kana is a girl who was stabbed in the back a lot of times, Alice is a girl, who is too kind for this cruel world, Do... Oh no, it would be a spoiler :)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891740/extras/37f156f3f4ba8622419e5ed71c212fda.avif?t=1756922995\" width=627 height=111 /></span><br>After 3 years of development, the game is finally on Steam! I am really happy to launch my first game. The original idea was to make a visual novel (lol), but in the process the story became shorter and it even changed the whole genre! I really like platformers like this one, so I tried to make a game that fits my likings the best. Hope you'll like it!","developers":["Innocent Soul"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891740/header.jpg?t=1756922995","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1891740/448109/668deb5a4afdabe37481a34cdf99805a08d0e3d7/1751043933/dash_av1.mpd?t=1648111463","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1891740/448109/668deb5a4afdabe37481a34cdf99805a08d0e3d7/1751043933/dash_h264.mpd?t=1648111463","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1891740/448109/668deb5a4afdabe37481a34cdf99805a08d0e3d7/1751043933/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1648111463","id":256878490,"name":"Lost Wish: In the desperate world - gameplay preview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256878490/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1648111463"}],"name":"Lost Wish: In the desperate world","package_groups":[{"description":"","